{"ticker":"TEAM","updated":"2026-11-27T23:24:31Z","profile":{"longName":"Atlassian Corporation","shortName":"Atlassian Corporation","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"Australia","website":"https://www.atlassian.com","fullTimeEmployees":13301,"marketCap":36757942272,"trailingPE":442.2727,"forwardPE":21.793829,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.318063,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":218.47562,"targetHighPrice":480.0,"targetLowPrice":150.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":32,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.237,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.85834,"operatingMargins":0.07598,"profitMargins":0.01284,"totalRevenue":6911904768,"beta":1.141,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":229.96,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":56.01,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Atlassian Corporation provides a collaboration software that enables organizations to connect all teams through a system of work that unlocks productivity at scale worldwide. The company's product portfolio includes Jira, Confluence, Loom, Jira Service Management, Rovo, Bitbucket, Compass, Jira Product Discovery, Focus, Talent, Trello, and Guard. It also offers Collections, a curated sets of apps and agents built on the Atlassian cloud platform and designed to solve cross-functional customer workflows, including teamwork, service, strategy, software, and product collections. The company was founded in 2002 and is headquartered in Sydney, Australia.","summary_zh":"Atlassian Corporation 提供一款協作軟體，使組織能夠透過工作系統連接所有團隊​​，從而在全球範圍內大規模釋放生產力。該公司的產品組合包括 Jira、Confluence、Loom、Jira Service Management、Rovo、Bitbucket、Compass、Jira Product Discovery、Focus、Talent、Trello 和 Guard。它還提供 Collections，這是一組基於 Atlassian 雲端平台建立的精選應用程式和代理，旨在解決跨職能客戶工作流程，包括團隊合作、服務、策略、軟體和產品集合。該公司成立於2002年，總部位於澳洲雪梨。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":168.1,"h":168.66,"l":164.92,"c":165.31,"v":2299100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":165.15,"h":165.285,"l":157.58,"c":159.7,"v":332